{
  "key": 62498,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCitySailorEldritchHouse_Text_GoingToBeSailor",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m going to be a Sailor like my\n",
        "daddy!\r",
        "He’s a real man among men!\n",
        "Even the sea doesn’t scare him!\r",
        "Oh, but a Gym Leader’d be cool, too!\n",
        "Byron is so awesome!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je veux faire comme papa, c’est\n",
        "un Marin!\r",
        "C’est un dur de dur!\n",
        "Même la mer le fait pas trembler!\r",
        "Oh, mais j’aimerais aussi être Champion\n",
        "d’Arène! Charles est trop génial!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCitySailorEldritchHouse_Text_ThrashingInSleep",
      "en_US": [
        "The little boy is thrashing about\n",
        "in his sleep.\r",
        "He appears to be in torment...\n",
        "He is muttering something...\r",
        "“DAR...\n",
        "DARK...is watching...me...”"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le petit garçon dort d’un\n",
        "sommeil agité.\r",
        "Il semble tourmenté...\n",
        "Il murmure quelque chose...\r",
        "“DAR...\n",
        "DARK... me... guette...”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCitySailorEldritchHouse_Text_LunarWingGlows",
      "en_US": [
        "The little boy is thrashing about\n",
        "in his sleep.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Lunar Wing began\n",
        "to glow...\r",
        "The boy’s sleeping face became\n",
        "untroubled and serene!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le petit garçon dort d’un\n",
        "sommeil agité.\r",
        "La Lun’Aile apportée par {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}\n",
        "commence à briller...\r",
        "Le visage du garçon semble désormais\n",
        "paisible et serein!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCitySailorEldritchHouse_Text_LittleBoyWokeUp",
      "en_US": "The little boy woke up!",
      "fr_FR": "Le petit garçon s’est réveillé!"
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCitySailorEldritchHouse_Text_ScaryDreamDarkPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "I couldn’t wake up...\n",
        "I saw it...\r",
        "It was a scary dream...\n",
        "It was a dark place...\f",
        "And there was a dark Pokémon...\r",
        "But, Daddy, Mommy...\n",
        "I could always hear your voices..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je n’arrivais pas à me réveiller...\n",
        "Je l’ai vu...\r",
        "C’était un rêve terrifiant...\n",
        "Un endroit très sombre...\f",
        "Et il y avait un Pokémon sombre...\r",
        "Mais j’entendais toujours les voix de\n",
        "mon papa et de ma maman..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCitySailorEldritchHouse_Text_YoureAwake",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, my gosh!\n",
        "You’re awake!\r",
        "Oh, my son...\n",
        "I... I don’t know what to say...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh, juste ciel!\n",
        "Tu es réveillé!\r",
        "Oh, mon fils...\n",
        "Je... Les mots me manquent...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCitySailorEldritchHouse_Text_WellNeverForgetYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you!\n",
        "We’ll never forget you!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Merci!\n",
        "Nous ne t’oublierons jamais!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCitySailorEldritchHouse_Text_ComeSailWithMe",
      "en_US": [
        "Seeing you back to normal makes\n",
        "me feel great!\r",
        "I’ve regained my spirit as a Sailor!\n",
        "Come sail with me later!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "C’est si bon de te voir en forme!\r",
        "Mon sang de Marin ne fait qu’un tour!\n",
        "Nous irons naviguer tout à l’heure!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCitySailorEldritchHouse_Text_TooMuchEnergy",
      "en_US": [
        "Our boy has too much energy!\n",
        "...That’s the best way to be!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Notre fils déborde d’énergie!\n",
        "... Il est en pleine forme!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCitySailorEldritchHouse_Text_WeFeelFrustrated",
      "en_US": [
        "I never thought our boy would fall into\n",
        "this endless nightmare...\r",
        "It’s happened in the past in\n",
        "Canalave...\r",
        "There were people who never woke\n",
        "up from their nightmares...\r",
        "...That is, until they were awoken using\n",
        "something called the Lunar Wing.\r",
        "My husband went to find a Lunar Wing\n",
        "on Fullmoon Island, but he failed...\r",
        "Does it take a Trainer to do that?\n",
        "We feel so frustrated by this..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je n’aurais jamais pensé que notre fils\n",
        "se retrouverait prisonnier de\f",
        "cet interminable cauchemar...\r",
        "C’est déjà arrivé dans le passé à\n",
        "Joliberges...\r",
        "Certaines personnes tombaient dans un\n",
        "sommeil infini peuplé de cauchemars...\r",
        "... Il n’y avait qu’un seul moyen de les\n",
        "en tirer: trouver une Lun’Aile.\r",
        "Mon époux s’est rendu sur l’Ile Pleine\n",
        "Lune pour s’en procurer une. En vain...\r",
        "Peut-être qu’il faut être Dresseur\n",
        "pour y arriver...\r",
        "Nous sommes désemparés..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCitySailorEldritchHouse_Text_CantThankYouEnough",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you! We can’t thank you\n",
        "enough, but thank you!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Merci! Nous ne pourrons jamais te\n",
        "remercier assez!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}